# The built-in theme under internal/app/theme/ is built into the program, and
# the golden files under internal/app/testdata/ are compared byte for byte with
# the page it gives, which has \n line endings on every platform. Windows git
# checks out CRLF by default, which would put \r into a program built from a
# Windows checkout and fail those tests on the windows runner, for a difference
# that is not in the repository, so pin the working tree to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
